  "prefLabel": "Tra 207.01 Requests for Explanation of Adopted Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 207.01 Requests for Explanation of Adopted Rules.\n\n(a) Any interested person may, before 30 days after final adoption of a rule, request a written explanation of that rule by making a written request to the commissioner.\n\n(b) The request shall include:\n\n(1) The name and address of the person making the request; or\n\n(2) If the request is that of an entity, the name and address of the entity and the name and address of the representative authorized by the entity to make the request.\n\nSource. #4174, eff 12-1-86; EXPIRED 12-1-90\n\nNew. #5563, eff 1-28-93, EXPIRED: 1-28-99\n\nNew. #7927-B, eff 7-26-03, EXPIRED: 7-26-11",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra200.html"
